@startuml consult-flow
skinparam linetype ortho
hide footbox
title CONSULT: independent rounds → anonymous revision → synthesis → owner map
actor Owner
participant "CLI / MCP" as API
participant Watch
database "Private consult state" as State
participant "Panel (2–26, ≥2 providers)" as Panel
participant "Synthesis agent" as Synthesis
Owner -> API: consult spec; preview panel × rounds + 1 and usage
API --> Owner: High-cost plan; 1–3 rounds (default 2)
Owner -> API: Confirm (MCP preview_token / CLI --confirm)
API -> State: Durable consultation; seed / stable shuffled A–Z labels
API --> Owner: Accepted
loop Each round
 Watch -> State: Frozen repo commits and context
 Watch -> Panel: Accepted pinned, read_only tasks; detached snapshots
 note right of Panel: No setup / links; commit guard + HEAD baseline.\nCooperative guard, not OS isolation.
 Panel -> State: Complete current-attempt structured reports
 Watch -> State: Validate Recommendation, Reasoning, Risks, Confidence, Unknowns
 alt Later round
  Watch -> State: Strip provider/self-identification + metadata
  Watch -> Panel: All previous answers under stable labels; recipient marked yours
  Panel -> State: Revised answers + Changed: yes/no and reason
 end
 Watch -> State: round-done event
end
Watch -> Synthesis: Anonymous final answers; no seed / identity map
Synthesis -> State: GO / NO-GO / SPLIT; consensus, disagreement, recommendation, owner choice
Watch -> State: Owner report = synthesis + de-anonymised identity map + findings
Watch --> Owner: synthesis-ready event; get_report / pull via synthesis task
opt post_to configured and permitted
 Watch -> State: WALL summary once as owner (normal checks)
end
note over Panel,Synthesis: Anonymisation is best effort: style and content can identify authors.\nInvalid/incomplete answers wait for repair; cancellation blocks progression.\nRestart repairs partial registration without duplicate tasks/posts.
@enduml
